### 4.4 The FFN union coreset (where K3's knowledge enters)

Per v2 layer k, candidates on the folded prefix rows `x_k`:

1. **Trunk channels:** the 2-3 pooled T layers' `[gate|up]` rows, charted `C^T diag(w) .` (16,640 x 2-3 = 33k-50k channels). Target `FFN_T(h_l) . C` summed over the pool.
2. **K3 channels:** the 3-4 pooled K3 form-E layers (17,408 latent channels each = 52k-70k), lifted exactly as C10 lifts them (`c10_union_install.py`, "The lift, form E -> trunk width": routed gate/up rows `W1_s . W_down . T`, down prior `U . W_up . diag(g) . W2p / rms_mean`, shared experts, `routed_expert_norm` linearised at the mean rms, biases recorded as `chart_bias` diagnostics), with `T = C_out^T` and `U = C_in^T` taken from the **composed** charts `C_{K3->T} o C`. K3 dense L0 joins layer 0 as a plain SiTU MLP.
3. **Unit channels:** the FFN of each unit landing on layer k, lifted through the unit's refolded chart (section 7, item 4); its attention heads join the mixer pool of the same layer, zero-padded to the v2 head dims (ACE/qimg 128-dim heads, QVL32 80-dim [R unit specs; print at P0]).

Selection: `c14_union_coreset.CoresetFold` stage 1 (energy ranking on `x_k`; mixed text + media rows so media-firing channels can be chosen; **no per-source quota table**, which would be a type table by another name), 6,144 kept. **Per-component compression: 6,144 from >= 85k candidates (2 x 16,640 + 3 x 17,408 = 85,504 at the smallest pool) = 13.9x; trunk-only 5.4x; K3-only 8.5x.** Every component clears the 4x rule from tensor shapes alone, and the receipt verifies it from shapes (`fold_component` rows, section 5).

Refit: `down` [2048 x 6144] by prior-anchored ridge (C10's `w2` refit, streamed engine `--chunk 8192 --gram-block 16384` as in `launch_s5.sh`) against

```
Y_k(x) = FFN_T,pool(x) . C  +  w_k3 . TERM_K3,pool(x)  +  TERM_units(x)   [units only on media rows]
```

with `w_k3 = 0.03` = S5's design of record (`a003 = trunk/additive:0.03`, chosen by the C10 design sweep because the full additive union collapsed the trunk [R `launch_s5.sh` header, `c10/design_sweep/VERDICT.md`]). **Arm F-K3W:** `w_k3 = 0.1` (the sweep's runner-up `g01`). This is a design parameter chosen from measurements, not a gate (S7 decision policy).

