## 8. Behaviour checks the folded base must pass before training on top

**Pre-registration.** The rules below are logged in omni_lab as a `review` run (one rule per behaviour, rules file sha in the run) **before** the first fold run, exactly as the proxy's PASS_RULES were (run 38033). They are not weakened afterwards; a changed rule is a new review run and a new suite version.

| Id | Check | Instrument | Pass rule (pre-registered) | Kind |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| F0 | Structural | `safetensors_io` load, `ChimeraConfig.validate()` (untyped refuses charted blocks), every tensor finite, shapes = `co2-2b` meta build (1,923,133,041 params) | all true | functional gate |
| F1 | Provenance and compression | `v_fold_compression`: every `fold_component` row has `method <> 'copy'` (enforced by the CHECK), `clears_4x` for every union/select component, `fold_alignment` complete for 24 layers, lineage edges to every source | all true | functional gate (the ruling's "entire weight from folding") |
| F2 | Conformance | `python -m chimera_omni.conformance --dynamic` on the folded checkpoint: R3 (every modality's loss reaches every trunk tensor), R5 (relabel/drop of type ids is bit-identical) | pass, as the proxy did [V spec section 2] | functional gate |
| F3 | Text coherence (the fold-init success bar) | `run_omni_frozen_review.py` (bank v1 `0ee6bf14...`, greedy, 1,024 cap, emit-zero floor, three-prompt smoke) on the 2B; dossier into omni_lab `eval_run` plus a review package for Cyril | **Collapse-only**, per Cyril's artifact-tolerant read: emit-zero floor passes; the three-prompt smoke and >= 8 of 15 bank prompts produce on-topic language outside loops/termination artifacts (machine pre-screen: distinct-token ratio and loop detector as diagnostics; the human grade wins in `v_effective_grade`). Held top-1 vs T, KL vs T: **diagnostic columns only** | behaviour gate (human-reviewed) |
| F4 | Modality **in** carried by the fold | frozen-feature linear probes at layers 8 and 16 on held media rows for the five understanding tasks (image class, pan, speaker, music source, 3D shape), the proxy's instruments reused (`proof/v2_proxy_mixed.py`) | each task: probe accuracy >= chance + 0.20 **and** > the same probe on a random-init `co2-2b` of identical geometry (the August proof's untrained-baseline logic, 1.0 vs 0.219) | behaviour gate |
| F5 | Raw **out** route live | one-step x0 prediction at sigma in {0.1, 0.5} on held clean spans, decoded to pixels / wav / voxels | per modality: x0 MSE < the noised input's MSE and the real-signal check (pixel std > 0.25x real, RMS 0.25-4x, occupancy 0.25-4x); non-finite = fail | behaviour gate (route) |
| F6 | Raw out quality | the proxy's generation instruments on 16-step Euler samples | **recorded, not gated** for the fold-only base; they become gates at stage S1 | diagnostic |
