A candidate passes when F0-F5 and F7 pass. Then: checkpoint, register in the ledger (`oc_checkpoint.py`), **clone** (`co2-2b-F<arm>-clone-pretrain`) before any training touches it (09-01 ruling), and package F3 for Cyril's review. Training on top (spec section 9, stages S1+) starts only after his review.

